{"id":"lengua","lemma":"lengua","pos":"noun","rank":1271,"glosses":["tongue (organ)","language (a body of words, and set of methods of combining them (called a grammar), understood by a community and used as a form of communication)","Spanish (subject taught in schools)"],"ipa":"/ˈlenɡwa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"lenguas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-lengua.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me mordí la lengua.","en":"I bit my tongue.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441626"},{"text":"Él habla diez lenguas.","en":"He speaks ten languages.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/58777"},{"text":"Nos mordimos la lengua.","en":"We bit our tongues.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/929168"},{"text":"Hablo unas pocas lenguas.","en":"I speak a few languages.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803859"},{"text":"A ver su lengua.","en":"Let me see your tongue.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458631"}]}